The headers in this folder are taken from ForbiddenItlwm
(https://github.com/retropineaple/ForbiddenItlwm, include/, commit 4a5491a6ed800ce693a72864e86a9a6a2e9cc5c6),
by retropineaple and contributors, licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2, like this driver
(see LICENSE in the root of this repository).

They are the chip-independent AWDL pieces of that driver: action and data frame parsing and building, the
synchronization parameters TLV, the fixed local schedule, the master indication TLVs and the receive metadata the
Family's peer manager wants. The only change is the include style: "AWDL*.hpp" with quotes instead of <AWDL*.hpp>,
so the AWDL interface, which is compiled on its own, needs no extra include path.
